# hoteling — hotel room booking (Kiosk demo)

AI assistants: start at [/.well-known/kiosk.json](/.well-known/kiosk.json) and read it with the skill at <<%= Kiosk.configuration.skill_url %>>.

## Try it with your own assistant

Tell your AI assistant: "Book me a room in Istanbul at hoteling.demo.kiosk.tech for next weekend."

It finds the hotel, registers itself, checks free rooms and books. You need no account and no app. The hotel confirms a booking only once it is paid. When it gives you the Stripe checkout link, save the test card 4242 4242 4242 4242, any future expiry, any CVC, any ZIP. Payment runs on Stripe in test mode: no real money moves. If the hotel declines, the charge is refunded.

## About this demo

hoteling is a demo hotel-booking site. Your assistant checks free rooms and prices, and the hotel confirms a booking once it is paid.

- Source: <https://github.com/kiosk-hq/kiosk/tree/main/kiosk-demo-hoteling>

